  "instructions": [
    "Cut the avocado into small pieces and place them in a large bowl.",
    "Add the thinly sliced red onion and diced yellow pepper to the bowl.",
    "Squeeze the lime juice over the mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Just before serving, spoon the ceviche into scallop shells.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
